steps.diagnosis_json:
{"spec_element": "invariant",
 "proof_obligation": "preservation",
 "diagnosis": "The invariant uses '(pos == i - 1 || arr[pos + 1] > elem)' to assert that no further occurrences of elem exist between pos and i. This is not maintainable: when pos == i-1 and arr[i] != elem, after incrementing i the condition becomes 'pos == i || arr[pos+1] > elem', which reduces to 'arr[i] > elem' — a claim about ordering that has no support without a sortedness precondition. The invariant should instead assert that no element in the range (pos, i) equals elem."}

